      "text": "영작문제 1 답안"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음 문제를 영작해주세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "109",
          "text": "Did you draw a map for me?"
        },
        {
          "n": "110",
          "text": "This is a homemade bomb, isn't this?"
        },
        {
          "n": "111",
          "text": "Can't you stay here during the vacation?"
        },
        {
          "n": "112",
          "text": "Don't you know the name of the poet?"
        },
        {
          "n": "113",
          "text": "Oh, it's on the tip of my tongue."
        },
        {
          "n": "114",
          "text": "The novelist won(received) the Nobel Prize, didn't he?"
        },
        {
          "n": "115",
          "text": "Bob is leaving for England next week, isn't he?."
        },
        {
          "n": "116",
          "text": "Wasn't this measure much more effective?"
        },
        {
          "n": "117",
          "text": "Isn't New York a fascinating city?"
        },
        {
          "n": "118",
          "text": "You don't agree with me, do you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "119",
          "text": "Didn't the clerk get a 50% pay-raise?"
        },
        {
          "n": "120",
          "text": "The rumor is true, isn't it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "121",
          "text": "The murder suspect wasn't innocent, was he?"
        },
        {
          "n": "122",
          "text": "Will this do?"
        },
        {
          "n": "123",
          "text": "Nothing could be better."
        },
        {
          "n": "124",
          "text": "Does this road take me home?"
        },
        {
          "n": "125",
          "text": "That's beyond me."
        },
        {
          "n": "126",
          "text": "Were you making a reservation?"
        },
        {
          "n": "127",
          "text": "You went fishing, didn't you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "128",
          "text": "Weren't they crossing the street here?"
        },
        {
          "n": "129",
          "text": "Won't you drop in on me?"
        },
        {
          "n": "130",
          "text": "You didn't follow my advice, did you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "131",
          "text": "Why don't you take a rest?"
        },
        {
          "n": "132",
          "text": "Why couldn't he realize his dream?"
        },
        {
          "n": "133",
          "text": "How many times a year does he go on a picnic?"
        },
        {
          "n": "134",
          "text": "How do you pronounce this word?"
        },
        {
          "n": "135",
          "text": "I don't quite get your point."
        },
        {
          "n": "136",
          "text": "Does that make sense?"
        },
        {
          "n": "137",
          "text": "How do you spell it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "138",
          "text": "Will(would) you speak more slowly, please?"
        },
        {
          "n": "139",
          "text": "May I have your phone number?"
        },
        {
          "n": "140",
          "text": "Where can I reach you?"
        },
        {
          "n": "141",
          "text": "I can't hear you very well."
        },
        {
          "n": "142",
          "text": "Isn't this your first visit to Canada?"
        },
        {
          "n": "143",
          "text": "Isn't he working for(at) a bank?"
        },
        {
          "n": "144",
          "text": "Let's listen to him."
        },
        {
          "n": "145",
          "text": "He was making a great speech, wasn't he?"
        }
      ]
    },
